cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If ORFscape contributes to a publication, please cite this repository and the version you used."
title: "ORFscape: layered-ORF proteogenomics pipeline with mass-spectrometry evidence arbitration"
abstract: >-
  ORFscape builds a layered ORF database from a genome (annotated CDS, ab initio
  predictions, six-frame ORFs, N-terminal extensions, transcript evidence; spliced
  proteins and junction peptides for eukaryotes), searches it against DDA mass
  spectra, filters novel peptides, arbitrates them per spectrum, and classifies the
  events into a report. A desktop GUI, a CLI and an agent-driven runner share the
  same event stream.
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Songhao
    affiliation: "Institute of Military Medicine, Academy of Military Sciences"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Songhao-Jiang/ORFscape"
keywords:
  - proteogenomics
  - novel peptides
  - novel ORFs
  - N-terminal extension
  - mass spectrometry
  - prokaryote
  - eukaryote
